What this repository contains that it did not write, and what it only runs.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
internal/cparse/predefined.h

The predefined-macro block of clang 23.1.4 for wasm32-wasip1, as printed by
`clang -dM -E` (`coracle predefined`). It is a list of facts about the target
(sizes, limits, feature macros), regenerated by the tool and checked by the
tests. LLVM is licensed under the Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exceptions
(https://llvm.org/LICENSE.txt).

