------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Downloaded or run, never committed or redistributed

- LLVM/clang 23.1.4 release binaries (Apache-2.0 with LLVM Exceptions), fetched
  by `coracle toolchain` and checked against the sha256 in
  internal/provision/provision.go.
- wasi-libc, commit d9ad2d11991c (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, Apache-2.0
  and MIT; musl under src is MIT, dlmalloc is CC0), built into a sysroot with
  that clang. Its build also fetches the compiler-rt builtins of a wasi-sdk
  release, which the LLVM release does not ship for wasm32.
- The gcc 15.2.0 testsuite, gcc.c-torture/execute (GPL): test input for the
  oracle, fetched by commit from the gcc mirror, never copied here.
- c-testsuite, commit 5c7275656d75 (harness MIT; each test carries its own
  licence in its .otag file): fetched by commit, never copied here.

testdata/programs/*.c are original programs written for this repository
(BSD-3-Clause); testdata/programs.golden records what the oracle did with them.
